    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"MockServerRestTemplateCustomizer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>MockServerRestTemplateCustomizer</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"MockServerRestTemplateCustomizer.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>MockServerRestTemplateCustomizer</code></a> 实例。",
      "count": 5
    },
    {
      "source": "Set if root URIs from <a href=\"RootUriRequestExpectationManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>RootUriRequestExpectationManager</code></a> should be detected\nand applied to the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/MockRestServiceServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>MockRestServiceServer</code></a>.",
      "translation": "设置是否应检测来自 <a href=\"RootUriRequestExpectationManager.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.restclient.test\"><code>RootUriRequestExpectationManager</code></a> 的根 URI 并应用于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/MockRestServiceServer.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>MockRestServiceServer</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "If the customizer is only used once, the <a href=\"#getServer()\"><code>getServer()</code></a> method can be used to\nobtain the mock server. If the customizer has been used more than once the\n<a href=\"#getServer(org.springframework.web.client.RestTemplate)\"><code>getServer(RestTemplate)</code></a> or <a href=\"#getServers()\"><code>getServers()</code></a> method must be used to access\nthe related server.",
      "translation": "如果自定义器仅使用一次，可以使用<a href=\"#getServer()\"><code>getServer()</code></a>方法获取模拟服务器。如果自定义器已使用多次，则必须使用<a href=\"#getServer(org.springframework.web.client.RestTemplate)\"><code>getServer(RestTemplate)</code></a>或<a href=\"#getServers()\"><code>getServers()</code></a>方法来访问相关的服务器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If a mock server is used in more than one test case in a test class, it might be\nnecessary to reset the expectations on the server between tests using\n<code>getServer().reset()</code> or <code>getServer(restTemplate).reset()</code>.",
      "translation": "如果在一个测试类中的多个测试用例使用模拟服务器，则可能需要使用 `<code>getServer().reset()</code>` 或 `<code>getServer(restTemplate).reset()</code>` 在测试之间重置服务器上的期望。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Callback to customize a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a> instance.",
      "translation": "回调用于自定义 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/client/RestTemplate.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.client\"><code>RestTemplate</code></a> 实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Set if the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/http/client/BufferingClientHttpRequestFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.http.client\"><code>BufferingClientHttpRequestFactory</code></a> wrapper should be used to\nbuffer the input and output streams, and for example, allow multiple reads of the\nresponse body.",
      "translation": "设置是否应使用 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/http/client/BufferingClientHttpRequestFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.http.client\"><code>BufferingClientHttpRequestFactory</code></a> 包装器来缓冲输入和输出流，并例如允许多次读取响应体。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>detectRootUri</code> - if root URIs should be detected",
      "translation": "<code>detectRootUri</code> - 如果应检测根 URI",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Phillip Webb, Moritz Halbritter, Chinmoy Chakraborty",
