    {
      "source": "<code>expectationManagerSupplier</code> - a supplier that provides the\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/test/web/client/RequestExpectationManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.test.web.client\"><code>RequestExpectationManager</code></a> to use",
